== Icelandic ==
===Etymology===
From ''[[hús#Icelandic|hús]]'' (meaning "[[house]]") + ''[[bóndi#Icelandic|bóndi]]'' (meaning "[[farmer]]").
=== Noun ===
'''húsbóndi''' {{m}}
# [[master]]
#* ''[[ég#Icelandic|Ég]] [[vera#Icelandic|er]] '''húsbóndinn''' [[á#Icelandic|á]] [[þessi|þessu]] [[heimili]]!''
#*: [[I]] am the '''master''' of [[this]] [[household]]!

====Synonyms====
*{{i-c|master}} [[yfirmaður]] {{m}}, [[herra]] {{m}}

